# PRE-LAUNCH: the X-Robots-Tag line below keeps the site out of search results
# for any crawler that ignores robots.txt but honours noindex; `nofollow` also
# tells it not to follow (or attribute) links out of these pages. REMOVE THAT
# LINE AT LAUNCH, together with public/robots.txt. Leave every other header.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
